EACL for Jank
==============

This repository contains a port and adaptation of EACL, originally developed
at https://github.com/theronic/eacl and distributed under the Eclipse Public
License 2.0.

The frozen upstream source baseline is pull request #145 at commit
1cbf80c7aaf4bfcf2564d2bf30135794ff406383, based on pull request #144 at
commit 0bb0845139af1acd4dc36fa5676e3cd68c6d7356. Exact source roots, hashes,
copied paths, and deliberate omissions are recorded in
compat/manifests/port.edn.

The upstream repository stores the complete license under the British-spelled
filename LICENCE. This port preserves that filename and file content verbatim.

The in-memory Janktomic module is a conformance and development backend. That
prototype designation does not apply to the EACL authorization engine, whose
correctness and performance are release-gated.
